# Seam edges (mitcad#1773) on the reported design of the private test files
# (MITCAD_MITCAD_REPORTED, seam-edges/; never committed): a lattice of
# balls and rods (Revolve, Pipe along a 3D sketch, Circular Pattern,
# Fillet) in one body, F2.b0. The rods' and balls' seams (at least the 20
# along the rods) are left out; the fillets' boundaries and the joints of
# rods and balls are still drawn.
# Run by tools/ui-seam-edges-test.sh when the design is there.
expect-ever 'View area'
wait-idle

expect-view-seams F2.b0 1+ 20+
